WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.820
- Disgraced celebrity
lawyer Michael Avenatti

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.810
sentenced to two and a half years in jail

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.130
for a scheme related to suing Nike.

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:09.150
If you don't recall,
Michael Avenatti represented

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.190
a putative whistleblower
who said that Nike

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:13.410
was paying high school
and college students

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.360
to sign Nike endorsement deals,

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.750
which was, of course, illegal.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.420
But the problem for
Avenatti is that not only

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:20.010
was he trying to get money for his client,

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.250
he was also trying to
get money for himself.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:25.480
He tried to extort Nike
for millions of dollars

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:28.040
so that he could run an
internal investigation

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:31.020
of Nike's practices and he'd
get paid as a consultant.

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.840
Pro tip, as a lawyer you
are not allowed to do that.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.430
So a jury convicted Avenatti

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.170
on three counts related to extortion,

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.160
interstate communications
related to extortion,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.340
and wire fraud.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.550
And he now has been sentenced

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.630
to two and a half years in
jail, and, on top of that,

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.640
he faces other charges in California

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.210
where he could face
even more time in jail.

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.753
So we're definitely going to
see Michael Avenatti in court!

